          "id": "if-you-expect-your-employment-tax-liability-to-b",
          "label": "If you expect your employment tax liability to be $1,000 or less in a full calendar year and want to file Form 941 annually instead of Forms 941 quarterly, check here. (Your employment tax liability will generally be $1,000 or less if you expect to pay $5,000 or less, $6,536 or less if you're in a U.S. territory, in total wages.) If you don't check this box, you must file Form 941 for every quarter",
          "response": "",
          "hints": {
            "expectedDataType": "boolean"
